Package: fastINFLECT
Title: Fast discovery of the metaclustering endpoint for SOM objects
Type: Package
Author: Jan VERHOEFF
Maintainer: Jan VERHOEFF <j.verhoeff@amsterdamumc.nl>
URL: https://mdmanurung.github.io/fastINFLECT, https://github.com/mdmanurung/fastINFLECT
BugReports: https://github.com/mdmanurung/fastINFLECT/issues
Description: Fast quality control and diagnostic selection of metacluster
    counts for high-dimensional 'FlowSOM' and 'kohonen' self-organising maps.
    Marker marginals are scored with separate Hartigan dip-test and
    interquartile-range criteria, with criterion-level evidence retained for
    inspection. Memoised hierarchy cuts, indexed marker-at-a-time scoring,
    deterministic sampling, and compiled accelerators reduce the cost of
    evaluating literal cluster-count schedules. Fitted endpoints are reported
    as estimates and are distinguished from materialised partitions. These
    diagnostics can detect evidence against unimodality but do not prove that a
    cluster is truly unimodal. The original 'INFLECT' implementation is
    available at <https://github.com/jnverhoeff/GarciaVallejoLab>.
